  "notModeled": [
    "analog input and reference ladder (VRT/VRB, self-bias VRTS/VRBS); the result is always the 0 V code 0x00",
    "pipeline latency of 2.5 clock cycles (the code is constant); sampling on CLK falling, output valid tOD after CLK rising",
    "timing values are typical only (no maximum given): tOD 28 ns (data rising), tEN 22 ns, tDIS 12 ns",
    "conversion rate limits (1-20 MHz typ, 15 MSPS specified); at least two clocks after power-up",
    "no power-down pin; stopping the clock reduces power",
    "pins 11 and 13 are both DVDD; pin 11 may be lower than the +3 V supply to ease low-voltage interfacing (p.20), not reflected in vcc"
